OL,5,G1900 Caribbean with Simon Reeve
OL,6,     FSimon begins his journey on the
OL,7,     Fisland of Hispaniola and its two
OL,8,     Fvery different countries of the
OL,9,     FDominican Republic - a tourist
OL,10,     Fhotspot - and its poorer neighbour
